@page "/components/icons"
@namespace Bluent.UI.Demo.Pages.Components
@using Bluent.UI.Icons
<PageTitle>Icons</PageTitle>

<div class="p-5 py-md-10 px-md-12">
    <div class="icon-page">
        <h1>Icons</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary">Render a catalog glyph, trusted inline SVG, or an image through the same 1em viewport. The caller owns the size and accessible meaning.</p>

        <section class="icon-controls">
            <div>
                <label for="icon-size">Inherited font size</label>
                <select id="icon-size" @bind="_size">
                    <option value="16">16 px</option>
                    <option value="20">20 px</option>
                    <option value="24">24 px</option>
                    <option value="32">32 px</option>
                    <option value="40">40 px</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div>
                <label for="icon-variant">Glyph variant</label>
                <select id="icon-variant" @bind="_selectedVariant">
                    <option value="@IconVariant.Regular">Regular</option>
                    <option value="@IconVariant.Filled">Filled</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <p class="icon-control-note">The selected size changes the parent font size. The Icon itself has no Size parameter.</p>
        </section>

        <h2>Source kinds</h2>
        <div class="icon-source-grid" style="@InheritedSizeStyle">
            <article class="icon-demo-card">
                <h3>CSS font glyph</h3>
                <div class="icon-stage">
                    <Icon Value="@FluentIcons.Settings" Variant="@_selectedVariant" aria-hidden="true" />
                    <Icon Value="@FluentIcons.Search" Variant="@_selectedVariant" aria-hidden="true" />
                    <Icon Value="@FluentIcons.Save" Variant="@_selectedVariant" aria-hidden="true" />
                </div>
                <p>Root: <code>&lt;i&gt;</code>. The glyph uses the bundled Fluent font and inherits <code>currentColor</code>.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="icon-demo-card">
                <h3>Trusted inline SVG</h3>
                <div class="icon-stage">
                    <Icon Value="@CustomSvgIcon" role="img" aria-label="Information" />
                    <Icon Value="@CustomSvgIcon" aria-hidden="true" />
                </div>
                <p>Root: <code>&lt;span&gt;</code>. The SVG has a valid <code>viewBox</code> and uses <code>currentColor</code>. A meaningful name is supplied at the usage site.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="icon-demo-card">
                <h3>Image source</h3>
                <div class="icon-stage">
                    <Icon Value="@PowerPointIcon" alt="PowerPoint file type" />
                    <Icon Value="@PowerPointIcon" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
                </div>
                <p>Root: <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>. Informative images receive <code>alt</code>; decorative images use an empty alternative text and are hidden from assistive technology.</p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <h2>Variant fallback</h2>
        <section class="icon-demo-card icon-fallback-card">
            <div class="icon-stage icon-stage-large">
                <Icon Value="@RegularOnlyIcon" Variant="@IconVariant.Regular" aria-hidden="true" />
                <Icon Value="@RegularOnlyIcon" Variant="@IconVariant.Filled" aria-hidden="true" />
            </div>
            <p>This definition contains only a Regular source. Requesting Filled deliberately falls back to Regular; no synthetic Filled glyph is generated.</p>
        </section>

        <h2>Caller-controlled viewport</h2>
        <section class="icon-demo-card">
            <div class="icon-stage icon-style-stage">
                <Icon Value="@FluentIcons.Settings" Style="width:40px;height:40px;color:rebeccapurple;" aria-hidden="true" />
            </div>
            <p>The explicit inline <code>Style</code> overrides the default <code>1em</code> viewport. Ordinary CSS classes can also set the rendered size.</p>
        </section>

        <h2>Accessibility and parent actions</h2>
        <div class="icon-source-grid">
            <article class="icon-demo-card">
                <h3>Decorative action icon</h3>
                <Button Text="Save document" Icon="@FluentIcons.Save" />
                <p>The parent Button owns the action name. Its icon is decorative and must not repeat the accessible name.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="icon-demo-card">
                <h3>Informative standalone icon</h3>
                <div class="icon-stage icon-stage-large">
                    <Icon Value="@FluentIcons.Settings" role="img" aria-label="Settings" />
                </div>
                <p>Standalone informative glyphs need a name supplied by the consuming page.</p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <h2>RTL context</h2>
        <section class="icon-demo-card" dir="rtl" lang="fa">
            <div class="icon-stage icon-stage-large">
                <Icon Value="@FluentIcons.ArrowRight" aria-hidden="true" />
                <Icon Value="@FluentIcons.ArrowLeft" aria-hidden="true" />
            </div>
            <p>آیکون به‌صورت خودکار در RTL وارونه نمی‌شود. منبع جهت‌دار مناسب را انتخاب کنید؛ فقط glyphهایی که متادیتای منبع اجازه می‌دهد باید mirror شوند.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
